// APW-4 -- Distinct-count cap -- CORRECT, permit form.
//
// Counts *requested* (in-flight + settled) sends, so the in-flight burst is
// charged against the `<= 3` cap.
//
// NOTE (reference semantics): the reference interpreter partitions temporal
// aggregates by the request's pinned key (`input.recipient`), so this is a
// per-recipient cap in the reference, not a global distinct-recipient cap.
// ROTN models the global distinct-recipient class; see
// docs/reference-replay.md for the honest side-by-side.
@id("apw4_permit_correct")
permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Send",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    (count for (t: Timepoint). where (
        formerly within 1h (Drupe::Action::"Send"::request{ input.recipient: context.input.recipient } && tp(t))
    )) <= 3
};
